WEBVTT

00:01.690 --> 00:05.360
<b>I am no longer able to 
lose our game tomorrow.</b>

00:06.010 --> 00:10.260
<b>I am very sorry. You may 
punish me any way you wish later.</b>

00:10.610 --> 00:14.190
<b><i>So I would ask you to please
 refrain from trying to win.</i></b>

00:15.070 --> 00:18.190
<b>So you know she's safe now. 
Told you I didn't do anything to her.</b>

00:18.420 --> 00:20.540
<b><i>Anyway, catch ya tomorrow.</i></b>

00:22.600 --> 00:24.330
<b>I see how it is.</b>

00:25.210 --> 00:27.830
<b>So the Little Devil was behind it all.</b>

00:28.720 --> 00:30.080
<b>Guess she's famous, huh?</b>

00:30.430 --> 00:33.500
<b>Well, with that personality 
and being a Six Star, yeah.</b>

00:33.500 --> 00:36.090
<b>She has to be one of the 
most famous people in Eimei.</b>

00:37.100 --> 00:41.000
<b>But I can't forgive her for 
kidnapping Yuki like that.</b>

00:41.000 --> 00:43.610
<b>Still, it was the perfect strategy.</b>

00:44.290 --> 00:47.360
<b>We also don't have proof that
 Akizuki's the brains behind it.</b>

00:47.360 --> 00:51.240
<b>There might also be someone else. 
She's really good at fooling people.</b>

00:51.240 --> 00:52.470
<b>Mnyah!</b>

00:52.470 --> 00:55.350
<b>She watches what she says 
and won't let anything slip.</b>

00:55.730 --> 00:58.950
<b>Wheeling and dealing is 
the Little Devil's specialty.</b>

00:58.950 --> 01:02.370
<b>Anyway, I don't know how 
we're going to win without Yuki.</b>

01:02.610 --> 01:04.880
<b>Cheating isn't my thing.</b>

01:05.230 --> 01:06.810
<b>That's the problem.</b>

01:06.810 --> 01:09.740
<b>I don't know how to contact
the Company, so what should we—</b>

01:09.740 --> 01:11.380
<b>I'm hooome!</b>

01:12.550 --> 01:13.800
<b>Kagaya-san?</b>

01:15.260 --> 01:19.660
<b>Uh-huh, Kagaya-chan. 
Dat's me. Probs. Maybe.</b>

01:19.660 --> 01:24.050
<b>Huh? What's Hiro-kyun doin' at my place...</b>

01:25.790 --> 01:26.980
<b>Nice timing.</b>

01:27.440 --> 01:28.270
<b>'Scuse me?</b>

01:29.830 --> 01:32.950
<b>Sh-Sh-Sh-Shirayuki-chan's missing?!</b>

01:33.240 --> 01:35.890
<b>Hiro-kyun, did you force 
yourself on Shirayuki-chan?</b>

01:33.480 --> 01:38.490
<b>A Fighting Chance 
in Eyes of Blue</b>

01:35.890 --> 01:38.020
<b>No way! She didn't run away.</b>

01:38.020 --> 01:41.160
<b>Akizuki probably ambushed her.
 She was kidnapped.</b>

01:41.160 --> 01:43.070
<b>Oh, how awful!</b>

01:43.420 --> 01:45.540
<b>And who's Little Miss Suspicious here?</b>

01:45.540 --> 01:48.730
<b>I'm, um... Shinohara's collaborator.</b>

01:49.390 --> 01:51.410
<b>Yeah. She's a friend I trust.</b>

01:51.770 --> 01:53.890
<b>And the interrogation stops there.</b>

01:53.890 --> 01:55.190
<b>Anyway, nice to meet you.</b>

01:55.190 --> 01:56.850
<b>Okay, I'll call you Hoodie Girl.</b>

01:57.290 --> 01:59.440
<b>W-Well, that's fine, I guess.</b>

