<b>Hey, what's wrong?</b>

07:40.640 --> 07:43.880
<b>Himeji told me, "Don't try to win."</b>

07:43.880 --> 07:48.400
<b>I know I can't just lose, 
but something about this is bothering me.</b>

08:00.120 --> 08:02.540
<b>Th-Thanks for waiting, Shinohara.</b>

