<b>I-I know I've said this already, 
but this is for my safety.</b>

08:13.860 --> 08:17.440
<b>I snuck out to come here even 
though it's way past my curfew.</b>

08:17.440 --> 08:20.480
<b>If I went back this late, 
I'd get in a heap of trouble,</b>

08:20.480 --> 08:24.230
<b>then be watched even closer, which 
would mean I couldn't help you tomorrow.</b>

08:24.230 --> 08:25.980
<b>I get it. I get it already.</b>

08:26.670 --> 08:29.860
<b>I wouldn't throw someone out 
in the middle of the night, anyway.</b>

08:30.380 --> 08:33.610
<b>Until Yuki gets back safely, 
I can't take the risk...</b>

08:33.610 --> 08:35.320
<b>I said it's fine!</b>

08:35.320 --> 08:38.330
<b>Jeez. If you're that nervous, 
go sleep in a different room.</b>

08:38.330 --> 08:40.730
<b>T-Today's special.</b>

08:40.730 --> 08:43.330
<b>I don't want to be alone. I'd get anxious.</b>

08:50.970 --> 08:52.670
<b>I-I'm turning out the lights.</b>

08:53.040 --> 08:54.840
<b>O-Okay.</b>

09:02.820 --> 09:04.480
<b>Hey, you still awake?</b>

09:05.600 --> 09:07.800
