<b>Why does it always have to be <i>you</i>?!</b>

19:43.180 --> 19:46.340
<b>Why? Why?! It makes no sense!</b>

19:46.340 --> 19:50.760
<b>I worked so hard to set all of this up!</b>

19:50.760 --> 19:53.030
<b>How could you <i>possibly</i> win?!</b>

19:53.280 --> 19:57.070
<b>It isn't right. You used dirty tricks 
to sneak your way to the top.</b>

19:57.550 --> 19:58.960
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

19:58.960 --> 20:02.990
<b>Becoming a Seven Star as soon as you 
got to Academy Island? There's no way!</b>

20:02.990 --> 20:06.130
<b>I really, <i>really</i> hate people who cheat!</b>

20:06.420 --> 20:10.720
<b>And remember what I told you?  How, in 
the Elimination Battle predicted rankings,</b>

20:10.720 --> 20:13.380
<b>you were way more popular, Hiroto-kun?</b>

20:13.380 --> 20:14.810
<b>Y-Yeah.</b>

20:15.600 --> 20:19.540
<b>And, you know, there was a poll like that
 at the closing ceremony before.</b>

20:19.540 --> 20:22.450
<b>Asking: "Who do you think 
will be the school's ace?"</b>

20:22.450 --> 20:25.070
<b>And I was at number one then.</b>

20:25.360 --> 20:28.710
<b>But the instant you transfer in,</b>

20:28.710 --> 20:32.550
<b>everyone turns their backs on me
 and flocks to you instead.</b>

20:32.550 --> 20:37.350
<b>I spend all those years working 
harder and harder to build myself up,</b>

20:37.350 --> 20:41.220
<b>then you show up out of nowhere 
and I lose everything in an instant?</b>

20:41.550 --> 20:45.920
<b><i>Whew, close one. Looks like she doesn't
 have any proof of our exploits, after all.</i></b>

20:46.490 --> 20:50.680
<b><i>But it's true that I'm cheating. 
And she's worked so hard...</i></b>

20:51.470 --> 20:54.970
<b>That's why I decided to get my revenge.</b>

20:55.270 --> 20:59.560
<b>Without your "Maid-chan,"
 you wouldn't be able to fight so well.</b>

20:59.560 --> 21:03.030
<b>I set it up so you two 
would have to face each other.</b>

21:04.360 --> 21:08.080
<b>Man, and it was so much trouble to set up.</b>

21:08.080 --> 21:09.840
<b>I even made a deal with that devil—</b>

21:11.850 --> 21:14.320
<b><i>That must be who's pulling the strings.</i></b>

21:14.320 --> 21:16.210
<b><i>Even if she's really talented,</i></b>

21:16.210 --> 21:19.700
<b><i>a student wouldn't be able to 
put all of this together by herself.</i></b>

21:20.560 --> 21:24.130
<b>Well, your scheme hit a brick wall. 
Come clean and tell us everything.</b>

21:26.310 --> 21:29.510
<b>What are you talking about? 
It's not over yet.</b>

21:29.510 --> 21:32.010
<b>I'm not going down like this!</b>

21:33.230 --> 21:39.230
<b>I'm so cute and clever, I made a backup plan
 in case something like this happened.</b>

21:39.230 --> 21:43.280
<b>The ability I installed on 
Maid-chan's Device works in two stages.</b>

21:43.640 --> 21:49.640
<b>When the main skill, Spying, is disabled, 
another one activates in the background.</b>

21:49.640 --> 21:50.530
<b>In the background?</b>

21:50.850 --> 21:53.860
<b>Yeah. And that skill is 
called Destructive Impulse.</b>

21:52.660 --> 21:58.540
<b>Destruc</b>

21:52.660 --> 21:58.540
<b>tive</b>

21:52.660 --> 21:58.540
<b>Imp</b>

21:52.660 --> 21:58.540
<b>ulse</b>

21:52.660 --> 21:59.670
<b>Destruc</b>

21:52.660 --> 21:59.670
<b>tive</b>

21:52.660 --> 21:59.670
<b>Imp</b>

21:52.660 --> 21:59.670
<b>ulse</b>

21:53.860 --> 21:59.790
<b>It smashes all of the data on that 
Device to bits. It's a really killer ability.</b>

21:59.790 --> 22:02.590
<b>All I have to do is press the start button,</b>

22:02.590 --> 22:05.930
<b>and Maid-chan's Device 
turns into a useless object.</b>

22:05.930 --> 22:06.830
<b>What?</b>

22:07.510 --> 22:12.550
<b>And then, Maid-chan won't be able 
to stay on Academy Island anymore.</b>

22:12.550 --> 22:16.550
<b>Are you sure about this? 
If they find out you used an illegal ability,</b>

22:16.550 --> 22:19.750
<b>the whole of Academy
Island will turn on you.</b>

22:19.750 --> 22:22.020
<b>I can't back down now!</b>

22:24.440 --> 22:25.510
<b>Himeji!</b>

22:26.450 --> 22:30.330
<b>Hey, Hiroto-kun, 
you and I should play a game.</b>

22:30.330 --> 22:33.830
<b>Not a Trial. A real game where we bet Stars.</b>

22:34.700 --> 22:38.080
<b>But it won't be fair and square.</b>

22:38.660 --> 22:41.770
<b>I'm fed up with all of that.</b>

22:43.380 --> 22:45.090
<b>Just like that devil,</b>

22:45.520 --> 22:51.320
<b>I sold my soul and now I can't go back.</b>

22:53.090 --> 22:56.060
<b><i>"That devil..." Who the hell does she mean?</i></b>

22:56.060 --> 22:57.610
<b><i>No, this comes first.</i></b>

22:57.610 --> 23:03.120
<b>So, Hiroto-kun, if you want me to return 
your little Maid-chan, lose to me, 'kay?</b>

23:03.120 --> 23:09.490
<b>Hand over your Stars right now, then 
bow down before me in front of everyone,</b>

23:09.490 --> 23:12.850
<b>and declare that I'm the one <i>true</i> 
Seven Star to pay for your sins!</b>

23:12.850 --> 23:17.030
<b>Doesn't that sound right? 
Because I <i>know</i> everything about you is a lie.</b>

23:17.350 --> 23:21.690
<b><i>Something seriously isn't right here. 
She knows too much. All I can think of...</i></b>

23:21.690 --> 23:25.790
<b><i>is the stolen Green Unique Star 
that enhances perception!</i></b>

23:27.070 --> 23:30.810
<b>I won't let you off the hook 
with a draw this time.</b>

23:30.810 --> 23:35.640
<b>We'll fight one last, decisive battle.
 Tabletop Treasure Hunt.</b>

23:35.640 --> 23:38.810
<b>All righty. Why don't we get started?</b>
